    {
      "id": 41,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Step 9 — Skills Pipeline Activation",
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 27, "w": 24, "h": 6 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Step 9: Skills Composition Pipeline\n\n**التحقق الحي:**\n```bash\n# اختبار /compose endpoint\ncurl -X POST http://localhost:8006/compose \\\n  -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \\\n  -d '{\"query\": \"اشرح قانون نيوتن الثاني\"}'\n\n# التحقق من مقاييس Pipeline\ncurl http://localhost:8006/metrics | grep cogniforge_pipeline\n\n# التحقق من startup_info مع pipeline_enabled\ncurl http://localhost:8006/metrics | grep 'cogniforge_orchestrator_startup_info.*pipeline_enabled=\"true\"'\n```\n\n**مسار الطلب:**\n`/compose` → `planning-agent:8002` + `research-agent:8007` (بالتوازي) → `reasoning-agent:8008` → إجابة مُركَّبة\n\n**Fallback:** كل Skill تعمل بشكل مستقل — فشل أي Skill لا يوقف الـ Pipeline."
      }
    }
  ]
